This sounds like game style difference - I tend to run out
of desire for ?oEA long before ?oEW.  I enchant up initial
mines armor then one by one switch to final pieces.  Plus
I keep a set of replacement armor in a stash and a few
specialty pieces in the bag like levitation or water walking.
Once I have those pieces of armor I might or might not
stash the rest but I no longer enchant any more.  +4 or
better fooproofed list of pieces then done.

But for weapons I guess I like to enchant more than I will
need.  Several stacks of missiles, primary and backup
melee, alternates for various specialized reasons, and I
continue to enchant all artifacts after I have all of the other
weapons I'll want.  But it isn't unknown for me to have a
+5/6 unihorn and/or pickaxe, just very low on the list in
an endurance game.

