I tend to use the pickaxe for digging and hoard several wands
for the planes.  That leaves me with a lot more wands than I
need but how many to carry down into the maze levels is a
tradeoff - the pickaxe in the bag weighs less than a couple
dozen wands and I like to clean a path in the maze so I can
move fast once I do get the amulet.


